              "text": "c. for a period of ninety (90) days following delivery, each Material and other deliverable provided by IBM under this Agreement will conform in all material respects to its applicable documentation and specifications; and d. the Materials and Services will not contain any virus, worm, time bomb or other malicious code introduced by IBM. Customer's remedy for breach of the warranties in this Section 5.1 is, at IBM's option, re-performance of the non-conforming Services, repair or replacement of the non-conforming Material or deliverable, or a refund of the fees paid for the non-conforming Services, Material or deliverable."
